      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Separating the overrides has been something requested for years. Having a single butting bypass all safety and security settings is objectively dumb. Why are there so many options if you just throw your performance and safety out the window because we have no other options for showing features on an individual user. I don’t care if it’s per session only, they need to allow us to separately show features for a user.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
