  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-02T10:42:00.412Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As a person that has their security settings to maximum i use the \"Show Avatar\" Button to show peoples avatars in case they are talking to me.\nThis becomes a problem when in a Big lobby all of these people are there. Hitting hard on the performance on my computer.\nIt would be great to have a Show/Hide Avatar per session Option, Where everytime you switch worlds or Log off and log back on the show avatar settings reset for those people.\nWhat do yall think?",
